## m12-17 box — gfx950 / CDNA4 (MI355X, mi35x)  ← ACTIVE GLM-5.2 BOX
- Host: `smci355-ccs-aus-m12-17.cs-aus.dcgpu`, gfx950, fp8 **e4m3fn**, 256 CUs, 160 KB LDS/CU.
- **Container `macui-glm5`**, image
  `raidenmakoto916/raidenmakoto:glm52-fork-aiter0724-ckaf7118-ckgemm1` (aiter 0724 base,
  CK `af7118e34`). `docker exec macui-glm5 bash -lc "..."`. GLM-5.2-MXFP4 server on port 8552.
- Only mount is `/data:/data`; the source trees live **inside** the container, so there is no
  host-side edit path — code reaches the box by push + fetch, never by editing files there.
- **`HF_HOME=/data/macui/hf_home`**. Model at
  `/data/macui/hf_home/hub/models--amd--GLM-5.2-MXFP4/snapshots/386bd0e4ec821f7b07975701cec3c3b953a5576a`.
- Server trees (`/sgl-workspace/`): `squidward` = `RM/glm51`, `squidward-gemm1` =
  `RM/glm52-ckgemm1`, `squidward-fp8` = the fp8 workstream, `squidward-main` = upstream ref.
- aiter trees (`/sgl-workspace/`): `aiter` = stock, pip-editable, **never touch**;
  `aiter-gemm1` = CK gemm1 (`RM/glm52-mxfp4-moe-ck-gemm1` + CK `RM/glm52-a4w4-k256-swizzle-fix`);
  `aiter_fp8`, `aiter_fp8_mixed`, `aiter_fp8_mixed_ck` = fp8 workstreams, not ours.
- `utilities/run_glm52.sh` pins **GPUs 4-7** (`HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4,5,6,7`). The box is shared
  with CI runners and other users' containers — check `rocm-smi` for idle GPUs first and never
  touch containers that are not yours.

Follow `remote-box-rules.mdc` for all box-safety constraints (no upstream edits, no pip install,
box never ahead of local, no git-state changes without explicit instruction, etc.).
